{"id":"ab975c5a8c0c0424","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-seven-tuple-tm-transition.md","title":"73-df-seven-tuple-tm-transition — seven tuple tm transition","display":"73-df-seven-tuple-tm-transition — seven tuple tm transition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-seven-tuple-tm-transition","display":"73-df-seven-tuple-tm-transition — seven tuple tm transition","depends_on":["[[73-df-seven-tuple-tm]]","[[73-df-seven-tuple-tm-configurations]]","[[73-df-dtm-local-transition]]","[[73-df-finite-path-closure]]"],"aliases":["73-df-seven-tuple-tm-transition","73-definition-7.3"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-seven-tuple-tm-transition"},{"key":"display","html":"73-df-seven-tuple-tm-transition — seven tuple tm transition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e0b452dd8be3146b\" href=\"?note=e0b452dd8be3146b\" title=\"73-df-seven-tuple-tm\">73-df-seven-tuple-tm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5878cb4e5741b073\" href=\"?note=5878cb4e5741b073\" title=\"73-df-seven-tuple-tm-configurations\">73-df-seven-tuple-tm-configurations</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"51696a3513b66fda\" href=\"?note=51696a3513b66fda\" title=\"73-df-dtm-local-transition\">73-df-dtm-local-transition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"25902d0bd75ea963\" href=\"?note=25902d0bd75ea963\" title=\"73-df-finite-path-closure\">73-df-finite-path-closure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-seven-tuple-tm-transition</span><span>73-definition-7.3</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,C&#39;\\in\\mathrm{Config}^{\\mathrm{fin}}_M\">\\(C,C&#39;\\in\\mathrm{Config}^{\\mathrm{fin}}_M\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e0b452dd8be3146b\" href=\"?note=e0b452dd8be3146b\" title=\"73-df-seven-tuple-tm\">73-df-seven-tuple-tm</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5878cb4e5741b073\" href=\"?note=5878cb4e5741b073\" title=\"73-df-seven-tuple-tm-configurations\">73-df-seven-tuple-tm-configurations</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{sgn}\">\\(\\mathrm{sgn}\\)</span> 是只作用于方向符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{L,R\\}\">\\(\\{L,R\\}\\)</span> 的位移函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T[h\\mapsto a]\">\\(T[h\\mapsto a]\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"51696a3513b66fda\" href=\"?note=51696a3513b66fda\" title=\"73-df-dtm-local-transition\">73-df-dtm-local-transition</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>本文件的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RTC}\">\\(\\mathrm{RTC}\\)</span> 固定载集为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Config}^{\\mathrm{fin}}_M\">\\(\\mathrm{Config}^{\\mathrm{fin}}_M\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"25902d0bd75ea963\" href=\"?note=25902d0bd75ea963\" title=\"73-df-finite-path-closure\">73-df-finite-path-closure</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_0\\subseteq(\\mathrm{Config}^{\\mathrm{fin}}_M)^2\">\\(R_0\\subseteq(\\mathrm{Config}^{\\mathrm{fin}}_M)^2\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RTC}\">\\(\\mathrm{RTC}\\)</span> 只在此二元关系域调用。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.3}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{sgn}\\coloneqq\\{(L,-1),(R,1)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.3}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{sgn}\\coloneqq\\{(L,-1),(R,1)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.3}\\vdash\nC\\vdash_M C&#39;\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists q,q&#39;\\in Q\\;\\exists T,T&#39;\\in\\Gamma^{\\mathbb Z}\\;\\exists h,h&#39;\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\n\\exists a\\in\\Gamma\\;\\exists D\\in\\{L,R\\}\\;\n\\bigl(C=(q,T,h)\\land C&#39;=(q&#39;,T&#39;,h&#39;)\\land q\\notin\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\}\n\\land((q,T(h)),(q&#39;,a,D))\\in\\delta\\land T&#39;=T[h\\mapsto a]\\land h&#39;=h+\\mathrm{sgn}(D)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.3}\\vdash\nC\\vdash_M C&#39;\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists q,q&#39;\\in Q\\;\\exists T,T&#39;\\in\\Gamma^{\\mathbb Z}\\;\\exists h,h&#39;\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\n\\exists a\\in\\Gamma\\;\\exists D\\in\\{L,R\\}\\;\n\\bigl(C=(q,T,h)\\land C&#39;=(q&#39;,T&#39;,h&#39;)\\land q\\notin\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\}\n\\land((q,T(h)),(q&#39;,a,D))\\in\\delta\\land T&#39;=T[h\\mapsto a]\\land h&#39;=h+\\mathrm{sgn}(D)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.3}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RTC}(R_0)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\mathrm{Config}^{\\mathrm{fin}}_M}(R_0),\\qquad\n\\vdash_M^*\\coloneqq\\mathrm{RTC}(\\{(C,C&#39;)\\in(\\mathrm{Config}^{\\mathrm{fin}}_M)^2:C\\vdash_M C&#39;\\})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.3}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RTC}(R_0)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\mathrm{Config}^{\\mathrm{fin}}_M}(R_0),\\qquad\n\\vdash_M^*\\coloneqq\\mathrm{RTC}(\\{(C,C&#39;)\\in(\\mathrm{Config}^{\\mathrm{fin}}_M)^2:C\\vdash_M C&#39;\\})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条目保留原调用记号；参数与类型由 Hypothesis 固定，Assertion 给出完整定义或结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-seven-tuple-tm","status":"resolved","id":"e0b452dd8be3146b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-seven-tuple-tm]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-seven-tuple-tm-configurations","status":"resolved","id":"5878cb4e5741b073","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-seven-tuple-tm-configurations]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-local-transition","status":"resolved","id":"51696a3513b66fda","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dtm-local-transition]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-path-closure","status":"resolved","id":"25902d0bd75ea963","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-path-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-seven-tuple-tm","status":"resolved","id":"e0b452dd8be3146b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{TM}$；$C,C'\\in\\mathrm{Config}^{\\mathrm{fin}}_M$，见 [[73-df-seven-tuple-tm]]、[[73-df-seven-tuple-tm-configurations]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-seven-tuple-tm-configurations","status":"resolved","id":"5878cb4e5741b073","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{TM}$；$C,C'\\in\\mathrm{Config}^{\\mathrm{fin}}